        <p source="#source-38334-38912"><seg source="#source-38334-38340">すか</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38340-38355"><rb>川</rb><rt>がは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38355-38358">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38358-38373"><rb>驛</rb><rt>えき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38373-38376">に</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-38376-38436" corresp="#source-38376-38400 #source-38403-38436"><seg source="#source-38400-38403">六</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38436-38463"><rb>等窮</rb><rt>とうきゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38463-38481">といふものを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38481-38499"><rb>尋</rb><rt>たづね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38499-38532">て、四五日とゞめらる。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38532-38547"><rb>先</rb><rt>まづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38547-38550">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38550-38574"><rb>白河</rb><rt>しらかは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38574-38577">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38577-38592"><rb>關</rb><rt>せき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38592-38619">いかにこえつるやと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38619-38634"><rb>問</rb><rt>とふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38634-38637">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38637-38661"><rb>長途</rb><rt>ちやうど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38661-38676">のくるしみ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38676-38700"><rb>身心</rb><rt>しんじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38700-38712">つかれ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38712-38727"><rb>且</rb><rt>かつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38727-38730">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38730-38754"><rb>風景</rb><rt>ふうけい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38754-38757">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-387