        <p source="#source-84208-84465"><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-84208-84271" corresp="#source-84208-84232 #source-84238-84271"><seg source="#source-84232-84238">二〇</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84271-84283"><rb>卯</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84283-84286">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84286-84301"><rb>花</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84301-84304">に</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-84304-84367" corresp="#source-84304-84328 #source-84334-84367"><seg source="#source-84328-84334">二一</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84367-84391"><rb>兼房</rb><rt>かねふさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84391-84400">みゆる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84400-84421"><rb>白毛</rb><rt>しらが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84421-84427">かな</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-84427-84465" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(5)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=5"><seg source="#source-84457-84465">曾良</seg></seg></p>
