        <p source="#source-88360-88639"><seg n="2" type="heading" rend="dogyo" source="#source-88360-88453"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88387-88411"><rb>尿前</rb><rt>しとまへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88411-88417">の關</seg></seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-88453-88643" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(3)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=3"><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-88483-88639"><seg source="#source-88501-88516">　　　七九</seg><lb source="#source-88516-88531"/><seg source="#source-88531-88549">備忘録八二頁</seg><lb source="#source-88549-88564"/><seg source="#source-88564-88579">　　　八八</seg><lb source="#source-88579-88594"/><seg source="#source-88594-88612">日記一二二頁</seg></seg></seg></p>
