        <p source="#source-89791-89922"><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-89791-89851" corresp="#source-89791-89815 #source-89818-89851"><seg source="#source-89815-89818">七</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-89851-89866"><rb>蚤</rb><rt>のみ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-89866-89884"><rb>虱</rb><rt>しらみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-89884-89890">馬の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-89890-89905"><rb>尿</rb><rt>ばり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-89905-89922">する枕もと</seg></p>
