furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113002-113017"><rb>比</rb><rt>ころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113017-113020">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113020-113044"><rb>汐風</rb><rt>しほかぜ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113044-113065"><rb>眞砂</rb><rt>まさご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113065-113068">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113068-113092"><rb>吹上</rb><rt>ふきあげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113092-113098">、雨</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113098-113125"><rb>朦朧</rb><rt>もうろう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113125-113134">として</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-113134-113194" corresp="#source-113134-113158 #source-113161-113194"><seg source="#source-113158-113161">二</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113194-113218"><rb>鳥海</rb><rt>てうかい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113218-113236">の山かくる。</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-113236-113296" corresp="#source-113236-113260 #source-113263-113296"><seg source="#source-113260-113263">三</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113296-113323"><rb>闇中</rb><rt>あんちゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113323-113326">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113326-113347"><rb>莫作</rb><rt>もさく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113347-113365">して、雨も又</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113365-113380"><rb>奇</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113380-113395">也とせば、</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-113395-113455" corresp="#source-113395-113419 #source-113422-113455"><seg source="#source-113419-113422">四</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113455-113473"><rb>雨後</rb><rt>うご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113473-113476">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113476-113503"><rb>晴色</rb><rt>せいしよく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113503-113506">又</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113506-113539"><rb>頼母敷</rb><rt>たのもしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113539-113545">と、</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-113545-113605" corresp="#source-113545-113569 #source-113572-113605"><seg source="#source-113569-113572">五</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113605-113620"><rb>蜑</rb><rt>あま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113620-113623">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113623-113638"><rb>笘</rb><rt>とま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113638-113644">屋に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113644-113659"><rb>膝</rb><rt>ひざ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113659-113677">をいれて雨の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113677-113695"><rb>晴</rb><rt>はるる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113695-113698">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113698-113713"><rb>待</rb><rt>まつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113713-113718">。</seg></p>
