      <div>
        <p source="#source-124946-125064"><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-124946-125006" corresp="#source-124946-124970 #source-124973-125006"><seg source="#source-124970-124973">五</seg></hi><seg source="#source-125006-125027">曾良にかたれば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125027-125042"><rb>書</rb><rt>かき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125042-125064">とゞめ侍る。</seg></p>
