      <div>
        <p source="#source-127812-128330"><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-127812-127872" corresp="#source-127812-127836 #source-127839-127872"><seg source="#source-127836-127839">一</seg></hi><seg source="#source-127872-127887">卯の花山・</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-127887-127947" corresp="#source-127887-127911 #source-127914-127947"><seg source="#source-127911-127914">二</seg></hi><seg source="#source-127947-127989">くりからが谷をこえて、金澤は</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-127989-128049" corresp="#source-127989-128013 #source-128016-128049"><seg source="#source-128013-128016">三</seg></hi><seg source="#source-128049-128055">七月</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128055-128073"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128073-128088">の五日也。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128088-128103"><rb>爰</rb><rt>ここ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128103-128106">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128106-128130"><rb>大坂</rb><rt>おほざか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128130-128151">よりかよふ商人</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-128151-128211" corresp="#source-128151-128175 #source-128178-128211"><seg source="#source-128175-128178">四</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128211-128232"><rb>何處</rb><rt>かしよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128232-128235">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128235-128250"><rb>云</rb><rt>いふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128250-128253">者</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128253-128271"><rb>有</rb><rt>あり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128271-128283">。それが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128283-128310"><rb>旅宿</rb><rt>りよしゆく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128310-128330">をともにす。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-128330-128701"><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-128330-128390" corresp="#source-128330-128354 #source-128357-128390"><seg source="#source-128354-128357">五</seg></hi><seg source="#source-128390-128399">一笑と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128399-128414"><rb>云</rb><rt>いふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128414-128426">ものは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128426-128441"><rb>此</rb><rt>この</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128441-128468">道にすける名のほの</seg><choice source="#source-128468-128477"><orig>／″＼</orig><reg>〲</reg></choice><seg source="#source-128477-128495">聞えて、世に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128495-128519"><rb>知人</rb><rt>しるひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128519-128522">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128522-128540"><rb>侍</rb><rt>はべり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128540-128585">しに、去年の冬早世したりとて、</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-128585-128645" corresp="#source-128585-128609 #source-128612-128645"><seg source="#source-128609-128612">六</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128645-128660"><rb>其</rb><rt>その</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128660-128672">兄追善を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128672-128690"><rb>催</rb><rt>もよほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128690-128701">すに、</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-128701-128795" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-128736-128795"><seg source="#source-128736-128748">塚も動け</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128748-128763"><rb>我</rb><rt>わが</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-128763-128778"><rb>泣</rb><rt>なく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-128778-128795">聲は秋の風</seg></p>
