        <p source="#source-128830-128925"><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-128830-128890" corresp="#source-128830-128854 #source-128857-128890"><seg source="#source-128854-128857">七</seg></hi><seg source="#source-128890-128925">ある草庵にいざなはれて</seg></p>
