      <div>
        <p source="#source-148493-150772"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148493-148514"><rb>漸</rb><rt>やうやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148514-148541">、白根が嶽かくれて</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-148541-148601" corresp="#source-148541-148565 #source-148568-148601"><seg source="#source-148565-148568">一</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148601-148619"><rb>比那</rb><rt>ひな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148619-148622">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148622-148637"><rb>嵩</rb><rt>たけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148637-148652">あらはる。</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-148652-148712" corresp="#source-148652-148676 #source-148679-148712"><seg source="#source-148676-148679">二</seg></hi><seg source="#source-148712-148748">あさむづの橋をわたりて、</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-148748-148808" corresp="#source-148748-148772 #source-148775-148808"><seg source="#source-148772-148775">三</seg></hi><seg source="#source-148808-148829">玉江の蘆は穗に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148829-148844"><rb>出</rb><rt>いで</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148844-148856">にけり。</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-148856-148916" corresp="#source-148856-148880 #source-148883-148916"><seg source="#source-148880-148883">四</seg></hi><seg source="#source-148916-148928">鶯の關を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-148928-148943"><rb>過</rb><rt>すぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-148943-148946">て</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-148946-149006" corresp="#source-148946-148970 #source-148973-149006"><seg source="#source-148970-148973">五</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149006-149027"><rb>湯尾</rb><rt>ゆのを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149027-149033">峠を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149033-149048"><rb>越</rb><rt>こゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149048-149057">れば、</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-149057-149117" corresp="#source-149057-149081 #source-149084-149117"><seg source="#source-149081-149084">六</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149117-149135"><rb>燧</rb><rt>ひうち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149135-149138">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149138-149156"><rb>城</rb><rt>じやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149156-149159">、</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-149159-149219" corresp="#source-149159-149183 #source-149186-149219"><seg source="#source-149183-149186">七</seg></hi><seg source="#source-149219-149246">かへるやまに初鴈を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149246-149261"><rb>聞</rb><rt>きき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149261-149267">て、</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-149267-149327" corresp="#source-149267-149291 #source-149294-149327"><seg source="#source-149291-149294">八</seg></hi><seg source="#source-149327-149399">十四日の夕ぐれつるがの津に宿をもとむ。その夜、月</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149399-149420"><rb>殊</rb><rt>ことに</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149420-149435"><rb>晴</rb><rt>はれ</rt></ruby>たり。「あすの夜もかくあるべきにや」といへば、「越路の習ひ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149525-149540"><rb>猶</rb><rt>なほ</rt></ruby><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-149540-149600" corresp="#source-149540-149564 #source-149567-149600"><seg source="#source-149564-149567">九</seg></hi>明夜の陰晴はかりがたし」と。あるじに酒すゝめられて、<hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-149678-149741" corresp="#source-149678-149702 #source-149708-149741"><seg source="#source-149702-149708">一〇</seg></hi><seg source="#source-149741-149771">けいの明神に夜參す。</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-149771-149834" corresp="#source-149771-149795 #source-149801-149834"><seg source="#source-149795-149801">一一</seg></hi><seg source="#source-149834-149849">仲哀天皇の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149849-149870"><rb>御廟</rb><rt>ごべう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149870-149876">也。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149876-149900"><rb>社頭</rb><rt>しやとう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149900-149921">神さびて、松の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149921-149933"><rb>木</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149933-149936">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149936-149951"><rb>間</rb><rt>あひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149951-149966">に月のもり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-149966-149981"><rb>入</rb><rt>いり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-149981-150002">たる、おまへの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150002-150023"><rb>白砂</rb><rt>はくさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150023-150029">霜を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150029-150044"><rb>敷</rb><rt>しけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150044-150062">るがごとし。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150062-150086"><rb>往昔</rb><rt>そのかみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150086-150089">、</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-150089-150152" corresp="#source-150089-150113 #source-150119-150152"><seg source="#source-150113-150119">一二</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150152-150176"><rb>遊行</rb><rt>ゆぎやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150176-150191">二世の上人</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-150191-150254" corresp="#source-150191-150215 #source-150221-150254"><seg source="#source-150215-150221">一三</seg></hi><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150254-150281"><rb>大願</rb><rt>たいぐわん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150281-150302"><rb>發起</rb><rt>ほつき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150302-150338">の事ありて、みづから草を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150338-150353"><rb>刈</rb><rt>かり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150353-150356">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150356-150377"><rb>土石</rb><rt>どせき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150377-150380">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150380-150395"><rb>荷</rb><rt>にな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150395-150398">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150398-150422"><rb>泥渟</rb><rt>でいてい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150422-150428">をか</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-150431-150476"><seg source="#source-150428-150431">は</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-150452-150461">（わ）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-150476-150491">かせて參詣</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150491-150518"><rb>往來</rb><rt>わうらい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150518-150521">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150521-150542"><rb>煩</rb><rt>わづらひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150542-150584">なし。古例今にたえず、神前に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150584-150605"><rb>眞砂</rb><rt>まさご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150605-150608">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150608-150623"><rb>荷</rb><rt>にな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150623-150626">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150626-150641"><rb>給</rb><rt>たま</rt></ruby>ふ。「これを<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150659-150683"><rb>遊行</rb><rt>ゆぎやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150683-150686">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150686-150710"><rb>砂持</rb><rt>すなもち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-150710-150713">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-150713-150731"><rb>申</rb><rt>まをし</rt></ruby>侍る」と亭主のかたりける。</p>
